Implement a clear data-source selector in development configuration, not a user-facing confusing toggle:
- Real mode reads from the Backend.
- Demo mode reads from isolated local fixtures.
- Empty mode renders no-data states when there are no connected accounts.
Never merge Demo and Real datasets.
Never persist Demo values to production tables.
Never show Connected for mock accounts.
Gate 2 — Pass conditions
